  "description": "- Replace the existing front garden boundary wall which borders the garden and the street, with a new wall to match the height of our neighbours wall. New wall will be with similar sandstone brickwork to match closely with the adjoining wall, with a single row of red brick inside\n- Remove privet hedge and replace with new hedge of Photinia bushes. The bushes will be junior bushes and will grow over time\n- Remove privet hedge between our property and no. 21, to the same height as the front wall. A planting border will be added on our side of the wall to allow for new bushes to be added\n- Replace broken paving in the garden with new paving leaving a rectangular planting area of approx 2.5m * 1.4m in size\n- Replace broken pathway paving with new Edwardian style mosaic path from the front door to the street",
